7. Scene & Panel Design
The story is divided into scenes and panels.
Scene Structure
Scene
│
├── Scene ID
├── Location
├── Time
├── Characters
├── Action
├── Mood
└── Panels
Panel Structure
Panel
│
├── Panel Number
├── Scene Description
├── Characters
├── Action
├── Dialogue
├── Narration
├── Sound Effects
└── Visual Prompt
This structure makes individual panels editable without regenerating the entire comic.
________________________________________
8. AI Prompt Design
A major part of the system design is how information is sent to Gemini.
Instead of sending only:
"Create a comic."
ComicCraft should provide context:
Genre: Science Fiction
Tone: Emotional
Main Character: Arjun
Character Traits: Curious, brave
Previous Events: Arjun discovered an abandoned robot.
Current Scene: The robot suddenly activates.
Task: Generate dialogue for this scene.
This approach helps maintain story and character continuity.
