18. Design Principles
ComicCraft should follow these principles:
•	Modularity — Each AI capability should be independently replaceable.
•	User control — AI generates suggestions; users can edit them.
•	Consistency — Character and story information should persist throughout generation.
•	Recoverability — Failed generation should not destroy existing work.
•	Scalability — The backend should support increasing users and projects.
•	Maintainability — AI prompts, API services, and UI components should be separated.
